cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CERIDWEN in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "CERIDWEN: Fast and Flexible GPU-Accelerated Stellar Population Inference"
abstract: >-
  CERIDWEN is a JAX-native, GPU-capable spectral energy distribution (SED)
  fitting package for galaxies. It provides a differentiable forward model
  (stellar populations, dust attenuation and emission, nebular continuum and
  line emission, IGM attenuation, redshift-aware observed-frame projection) and
  posterior inference via nested sampling and variational-inference
  preconditioned Hamiltonian Monte Carlo.
type: software
